cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite this software release and the associated paper."
title: "Replication Package for A Causal Theory of Persistent Functional Self in Embodied Artificial Agents"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-31"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NicholasShatokhin/cias-persistent-functional-self"
url: "https://github.com/NicholasShatokhin/cias-persistent-functional-self"
abstract: >-
  Frozen code, scientific protocols, raw diagnostic and confirmatory data,
  analysis scripts, and provenance records associated with
  "A Causal Theory of Persistent Functional Self in Embodied Artificial Agents".
  The materials support reproducibility of the reported experiments on
  persistent functional identity in simulated embodied artificial agents.
